/*!
    \class DualStore
    \inmodule HiddenFriendsClassTemplate
    \brief A two-type-parameter template class with an asymmetric hidden friend.

    The \a Lhs and \a Rhs parameters specify the key and value types.
*/

/*!
    \fn template <typename A, typename B> void dualCheck(DualStore<A, B> &a, A key) noexcept

    Checks \a a using \a key. Dual parameter marker. The documentation renames the
    template parameters and repeats the correct argument bindings.
*/

/*!
    \fn template <typename A, typename B> void dualCheck(DualStore<B, A> &a, B key) noexcept

    Checks \a a using \a key. Reversed dual parameter marker. Reversed argument
    bindings describe a different function; this command must not document the hidden friend.
*/
